.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH typst-update 1  "typst-update " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
typst\-update \- Self update the Typst CLI
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBtypst\-update\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-revert\fR] [\fB\-\-backup\-path\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIVERSION\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Self update the Typst CLI
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Forces a downgrade to an older version (required for downgrading)
.TP
\fB\-\-revert\fR
Reverts to the version from before the last update (only possible if `typst update` has previously ran)
.TP
\fB\-\-backup\-path\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Custom path to the backup file created on update and used by `\-\-revert`, defaults to system\-dependent location
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBTYPST_UPDATE_BACKUP_PATH\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIVERSION\fR]
Which version to update to (defaults to latest)
